=== Generated Answer (model draft; check against evidence) ===
The paper incorporates expert knowledge by letting users specify a set of "anchored" relevance variables—fuzzy and informal expert-provided words or domain knowledge—so that latent topics are optimized to be informative both about correlations in the data and about those expert-specified anchors [7]. This anchored approach builds on a combination of the information bottleneck and Total Correlation Explanation (CorEx), enabling users to impose semantics onto the latent factors learned by CorEx and guide exploration of a document collection [1][7]. Like seeded LDA, this allows the specification of word–topic relationships [6].
